      "description": "Format a range through Excel: number_format (e.g. '0.00', '#,##0', 'dd/mm/yyyy'), conditional formatting rules (conditional: [{kind:'cell_value', operator: greater|less|equal|not_equal|greater_equal|less_equal|between|not_between, value, value2?, fill_color?, font_color?} | {kind:'expression', formula, fill_color?, font_color?}]) and data validation (validation: {type: list|whole|decimal|date|text_length|custom, source (list, comma separated) | min/max/value + operator | formula, error_message?, prompt?}). Reads everything back from Excel and the saved sheet XML.",
